<title>POLAND: NBP OFFERS TO SELL PLN 400 MLN OF 273-DAY BILLS.</title>
<headline>NBP OFFERS TO SELL PLN 400 MLN OF 273-DAY BILLS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland</p>
<p>offered to sell 400 million zlotys of 273-day NBP-bills, the</p>
<p>central bank said.</p>
<p>Full details below.</p>
<p>    Deadline hour		 - 12:00</p>
<p>    Date of settlement	  - OCT 9, 1996</p>
<p>Maturity of bills offered - JUL 9, 1997</p>
<p>Due to technical problems the NBP was unable to announce</p>
<p>the operation.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
